	"Description": "[color=#ffff00][size=5]My mods are only here on Nexus, please don't post my work elsewhere![/size][/color]\n<br />[size=3]\n<br />I gave a bed in a separate room to [color=#00ffff]Marlon,[/color] [color=#00ffff]Gil, Gunther, Rasmodius, Sandy and Willy[/color], I had to make custom rooms to be as less invasive as possible with Vanilla, in fact I add only 1 or max 3 tiles to the original maps, they should probably be compatible with almost everything and they are [color=#00ffff]downloadable individually[/color].\n<br />[/size][size=3]In the game's cutscenes you can also see the trapdoor or the ladder, in the end it came out very naturally, but they won't go to sleep, this is just for aesthetics.\n<br />I love making these little tweaks to the game!\n<br />[/size][size=5][color=#00ffff]\n<br />Thank you for your support and Enjoy![/color][/size][size=3]\n<br />\n<br />Maybe you might be interested in my other [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/users/181358142?tab=user+files]Mods[/url]\n<br />\n<br />If you appreciate my work could you buy me a coffee [url=https://ko-fi.com/kanacane]Ko fi[/url] ?\n<br />\n<br />My Discord server. https://discord.gg/PEHYyagv6T\n<br />[/size]",
